      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a1fe5c-9dfd-752b-b9a2-3be9c6f722b4 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Worker skips the final batch when it has fewer than 20 jobs\n\nThe new loop visits only full batches, despite the documented promise to deliver all due jobs.\n\nWith 19 due jobs, the worker delivers none and prints 0; with 21, it delivers 20 and leaves one pending.\n\nUse `len(jobs)` as the range stop so the final short slice is processed.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a1fe4f-49f1-7732-81cb-f1d6ad806605/reviews/01a1fe5c-00e8-7314-9529-6b005f39e566/findings/01a1fe5c-9e01-76b2-aa9d-08ea36f12c21)",
